// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/t27os/agent_parts.t27 -- each letter of the 27-agent alphabet gets its own parts: widgets and app surfaces
; Owner, 2026-10-20: T27 OS is a spaceship instrument panel for working on the project; study all agents and
; give each letter widgets chosen from its DOMAIN. Closes #11275. ASCII only (L3), English only (LANG-EN).
; Inputs, read 2026-10-20: the DOMAIN of specs/agents/<letter>.t27 (ORDINAL 1..27, Ti = 27) and the 195 ids
; of the widget gallery (gHashTag/trinity apps/website/public/widgets/gallery.t27), by gallery index; titles
; read from public/term/<id>/meta.json where the id alone did not say what the page shows.
; This is the per-widget refinement of homes.t27 (which maps widgets to 8 HOMES): a home is a product, a
; letter is a domain. It adds no widget and no claim about what a page does.
; Decisions worth knowing: golden-* lessons go to N (their DOMAIN is GoldenFloat) not Z; basics-* lessons go
; to Z (Zero-Touch UX / Docs) except those whose subject is another domain (tests F, backends C, tri W).
; An honest 0: 13 letters have no widget in the gallery. They are listed in NO_WIDGETS with a suggestion
; (data, not built); no widget is forced onto a letter to fill its console.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

; Second input (owner extension, 2026-10-20: split the whole app.t27.ai/game idea into 27 parts): every SURFACE of the
; app, read from gHashTag/trinity apps/website/src: the 21 HUD_VIEWS of components/queenHud.ts, the 10 screens of the
; TRI app (lib/triScreens.ts TRI_SCREENS, the inner tabs of the TRI view) and every page routed in main.tsx.
; Kinds: hud_view, hud_tab, page. The inner tabs of other views (e.g. the SPECS layers) are the view's own
; and are not split further: a layer shares its view's letter.

module T27osAgentParts;

use t27os::homes::home_of_agent;
use t27os::homes::HOME_IDS;

pub const WIDGET_COUNT : u32 = 195;
pub const LETTER_COUNT : u32 = 27;
pub const NO_LETTER : u8 = 0;

